#ASSERT `Sch 2 para 1(2) the views of the Jersey Appointments Commission were sought before the appointment` `B of F9.14` (`build a member appointment` (YMD 2026 3 15) (YMD 2026 3 15) (YMD 2032 3 15) TRUE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 15)) (JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)) FALSE FALSE NOTHING `no earlier service`)
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 2 para 1(2) the views of the Jersey Appointments Commission were sought before the appointment` `A` (`build a member appointment` (YMD 2026 3 15) (YMD 2026 3 15) (YMD 2032 3 15) TRUE TRUE NOTHING (JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)) FALSE FALSE NOTHING `no earlier service`)

§§ `1(3): at least 2 weeks before appointing, a notice of intention`
#ASSERT `Sch 2 para 1(3) the notice of intention must be presented at least this many weeks before appointing` EQUALS 2
`B of F9.1` MEANS `the favoured interpretation, but F9.1 is read as B`
GIVEN notice IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH AN `Appointment of a member of the tribunal`
`a member appointment of 15 March 2026 with a notice on` notice MEANS
    `build a member appointment` (YMD 2026 3 15) (YMD 2026 3 15) (YMD 2032 3 15) TRUE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)) notice FALSE FALSE NOTHING `no earlier service`
-- appointment on 15 March 2026: the notice on 1 March (14 days before) is in time on reading A and not on reading B (14 clear days: 28 February); 2 March is late on both
#ASSERT `Sch 2 para 1(3) the notice of intention was presented to the States in time` `A` (`a member appointment of 15 March 2026 with a notice on` (JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)))
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 2 para 1(3) the notice of intention was presented to the States in time` `B of F9.1` (`a member appointment of 15 March 2026 with a notice on` (JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)))
#ASSERT `Sch 2 para 1(3) the notice of intention was presented to the States in time` `A` (`a member appointment of 15 March 2026 with a notice on` (JUST (YMD 2026 2 28)))
#ASSERT `Sch 2 para 1(3) the notice of intention was presented to the States in time` `B of F9.1` (`a member appointment of 15 March 2026 with a notice on` (JUST (YMD 2026 2 28)))
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 2 para 1(3) the notice of intention was presented to the States in time` `A` (`a member appointment of 15 March 2026 with a notice on` (JUST (YMD 2026 3 2)))
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 2 para 1(3) the notice of intention was presented to the States in time` `B of F9.1` (`a member appointment of 15 March 2026 with a notice on` (JUST (YMD 2026 3 2)))
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 2 para 1(3) the notice of intention was presented to the States in time` `A` (`a member appointment of 15 March 2026 with a notice on` NOTHING)
-- a re-appointment is an appointment (1(6)): a notice 14 days before a re-appointment on 15 March 2032 is in time
`a member re-appointment of 2032` MEANS `build a member appointment` (YMD 2032 3 15) (YMD 2032 3 15) (YMD 2038 3 15) TRUE TRUE (JUST (YMD 2032 3 14)) (JUST (YMD 2032 3 1)) TRUE FALSE NOTHING `no earlier service`
#ASSERT `Sch 2 para 1(3) the notice of intention was presented to the States in time` `A` `a member re-appointment of 2032`
#ASSERT `Sch 2 para 1(2) the views of the Jersey Appointments Commission were sought before the appointment` `A` `a member re-appointment of 2032`
-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Sch 2 para 1(3) at least 2 weeks before appointing a person as a tribunal member the Minister must present to the States a notice of intention` `A` (YMD 2026 3 15) AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 2 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the Minister` DOES `Sch 2: the Minister presents a notice of intention to the States to appoint a member` AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 1))

-- EXPECT: BREACH BY `the Minister`
#TRACE `Sch 2 para 1(3) at least 2 weeks before appointing a person as a tribunal member the Minister must present to the States a notice of intention` `A` (YMD 2026 3 15) AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 2 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the Minister` DOES `Sch 2: the Minister presents a notice of intention to the States to appoint a member` AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 2))

-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `Sch 2 para 1(3) at least 2 weeks before appointing a person as a tribunal member the Minister must present to the States a notice of intention` `B of F9.1` (YMD 2026 3 15) AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 2 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the Minister` DOES `Sch 2: the Minister presents a notice of intention to the States to appoint a member` AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 2 28))

-- EXPECT: BREACH BY `the Minister`
#TRACE `Sch 2 para 1(3) at least 2 weeks before appointing a person as a tribunal member the Minister must present to the States a notice of intention` `B of F9.1` (YMD 2026 3 15) AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 2 1)) WITH
    PARTY `the Minister` DOES `Sch 2: the Minister presents a notice of intention to the States to appoint a member` AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 1))

-- EXPECT: STANDING
#TRACE `Sch 2 para 1(3) at least 2 weeks before appointing a person as a tribunal member the Minister must present to the States a notice of intention` `A` (YMD 2026 3 15) AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 2 1)) WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 3 1)))

-- EXPECT: BREACH BY `the Minister`
#TRACE `Sch 2 para 1(3) at least 2 weeks before appointing a person as a tribunal member the Minister must present to the States a notice of intention` `A` (YMD 2026 3 15) AT (DATE_SERIAL (YMD 2026 2 1)) WITH
