#ASSERT NOT `Sch 2 para 1(5) the period of the appointment is within the limit` `B of F9.2` (`a member appointment from 2026-03-01 expiring` (YMD 2032 3 1))
#ASSERT `Sch 2 para 1(5) the period of the appointment is within the limit` `A` (`a member appointment from 2026-03-01 expiring` (YMD 2032 2 29))
#ASSERT `Sch 2 para 1(5) the period of the appointment is within the limit` `B of F9.2` (`a member appointment from 2026-03-01 expiring` (YMD 2032 2 29))
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 2 para 1(5) the period of the appointment is within the limit` `A` (`a member appointment from 2026-03-01 expiring` (YMD 2032 3 2))
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 2 para 1(5) the period of the appointment is within the limit` `B of F9.2` (`a member appointment from 2026-03-01 expiring` (YMD 2032 3 2))
