§§ `2(1): a person ceases to be a member of the tribunal`
`no resignation and no termination of a member` MEANS `Events that may end the position of a member of the tribunal` OF NOTHING, NOTHING
`a valid resignation of a member taking effect on 28 February 2027` MEANS `Events that may end the position of a member of the tribunal` OF (JUST (`build a member's notice of resignation` (YMD 2026 11 30) TRUE (YMD 2027 2 28))), NOTHING
-- one month's notice is enough for a member: a notice given on 30 November 2026 to take effect on 30 December 2026 (a month) is a resignation; the Commissioner would need 3 months
`a one month resignation of a member taking effect on 30 December 2026` MEANS `Events that may end the position of a member of the tribunal` OF (JUST (`build a member's notice of resignation` (YMD 2026 11 30) TRUE (YMD 2026 12 30))), NOTHING
`a resignation of a member on notice shorter than a month` MEANS `Events that may end the position of a member of the tribunal` OF (JUST (`build a member's notice of resignation` (YMD 2026 11 30) TRUE (YMD 2026 12 29))), NOTHING
`a termination of a member for illness taking effect on 1 January 2028` MEANS `Events that may end the position of a member of the tribunal` OF NOTHING, (JUST (`Termination of the appointment of a member of the tribunal` OF (YMD 2028 1 1), `member ill, the Minister satisfied`))
`a termination of a member with no ground taking effect on 1 January 2028` MEANS `Events that may end the position of a member of the tribunal` OF NOTHING, (JUST (`Termination of the appointment of a member of the tribunal` OF (YMD 2028 1 1), `member with no ground at all`))
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 2 para 2(1) the person has ceased to be a member of the tribunal by the day` `A` `a 6 year member appointment from 2026-03-01` `a valid resignation of a member taking effect on 28 February 2027` (YMD 2027 2 27)
#ASSERT `Sch 2 para 2(1) the person has ceased to be a member of the tribunal by the day` `A` `a 6 year member appointment from 2026-03-01` `a valid resignation of a member taking effect on 28 February 2027` (YMD 2027 2 28)
#ASSERT `Sch 2 para 2(1) the person has ceased to be a member of the tribunal by the day` `A` `a 6 year member appointment from 2026-03-01` `a one month resignation of a member taking effect on 30 December 2026` (YMD 2026 12 30)
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 2 para 2(1) the person has ceased to be a member of the tribunal by the day` `A` `a 6 year member appointment from 2026-03-01` `a resignation of a member on notice shorter than a month` (YMD 2027 1 30)
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 2 para 2(1) the person has ceased to be a member of the tribunal by the day` `A` `a 6 year member appointment from 2026-03-01` `a termination of a member for illness taking effect on 1 January 2028` (YMD 2027 12 31)
#ASSERT `Sch 2 para 2(1) the person has ceased to be a member of the tribunal by the day` `A` `a 6 year member appointment from 2026-03-01` `a termination of a member for illness taking effect on 1 January 2028` (YMD 2028 1 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 2 para 2(1) the person has ceased to be a member of the tribunal by the day` `A` `a 6 year member appointment from 2026-03-01` `a termination of a member with no ground taking effect on 1 January 2028` (YMD 2028 1 2)
#ASSERT NOT `Sch 2 para 2(1) the person has ceased to be a member of the tribunal by the day` `A` `a 6 year member appointment from 2026-03-01` `no resignation and no termination of a member` (YMD 2032 2 29)
#ASSERT `Sch 2 para 2(1) the person has ceased to be a member of the tribunal by the day` `A` `a 6 year member appointment from 2026-03-01` `no resignation and no termination of a member` (YMD 2032 3 1)
#ASSERT `Sch 2 para 2(1) the person has ceased to be a member of the tribunal by the day` `B of F9.3` `a 6 year member appointment from 2026-03-01` `a valid resignation of a member taking effect on 28 February 2027` (YMD 2026 11 30)

