#ASSERT `Sch 2 para 3(2) the members of staff who are the responsible officer` `A` `staff Dee` (JUST "Dee") EQUALS LIST "Dee"
#ASSERT `Sch 2 para 3(2) the members of staff who are the responsible officer` `B of F9.18` `staff Dee` NOTHING EQUALS LIST "Dee"
-- two available and the Minister has named Dee: reading A, Dee alone; reading B, both
