#ASSERT `Sch 2 para 3(2) the members of staff who are the responsible officer` `B of F9.18` `staff Dee and Eli` (JUST "Dee") EQUALS LIST "Dee", "Eli"
-- two available and nobody named, or a person named who is not available: reading A gives no answer; reading B, both
