#ASSERT REFUSED `Sch 2 para 3(2) the members of staff who are the responsible officer` `A` `staff Dee and Eli` (JUST "Fay")
#ASSERT `Sch 2 para 3(2) the members of staff who are the responsible officer` `B of F9.18` `staff Dee and Eli` NOTHING EQUALS LIST "Dee", "Eli"
#ASSERT `Sch 2 para 3(2) the members of staff who are the responsible officer` `B of F9.18` `staff Dee and Eli` (JUST "Fay") EQUALS LIST "Dee", "Eli"
-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
